{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56086","headline":"通玄赞八首 一 · 杜光庭","name":"通玄赞八首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"至道常虚寂，玄化应真精。\n分神通一切，凝景在三清。\n恍惚生有象，冲寞见无形。\n逐运开缘会，因机说娒对。\n修之登景汉，慢之堕幽囹。\n天女散金华，神童唱玉声。\n十华回宝盖，九凤遏云营。\n若能弘至赜，家国悉安宁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56086.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56086","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}